{"id":"161f2b7c-21f0-4dd1-96bd-d69a48338424","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:24:20.366Z","batchId":"pricing_qwen3-8-flash-gateway_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm center\">\n    <h1>Plans that grow with your team</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Start free forever. Upgrade when you need more projects, seats and automation. No credit card required for the Free plan.</p>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"badge\">14-day refund window</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Cancel anytime</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Trusted by 12,400 teams</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"cycle\" value=\"monthly\" checked> <span>Billed monthly</span></label>\n    <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"cycle\" value=\"annual\"> <span>Billed annually <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Save 20%</span></span></label>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n    <!-- Free -->\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <h3>Free</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">For individuals</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Everything you need to try the product and ship small projects.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div><span class=\"stat-value price\" data-monthly=\"$0\" data-annual=\"$0\">$0</span><span class=\"stat-label\"> / month</span></div>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" data-cycle-note=\"monthly\">Free forever. No card required.</p>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" data-cycle-note=\"annual\" hidden>Free forever. No card required.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-block\">Create free account</button>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Up to 3 projects</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>1 seat included</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>2 GB file storage</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Community support</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Basic dashboards</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm muted\"><span>—</span><span>Custom integrations</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm muted\"><span>—</span><span>Advanced analytics</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm muted\"><span>—</span><span>Audit log &amp; SSO</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Limits enforced automatically; you'll be notified before you hit them.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Pro (featured) -->\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\" style=\"outline: 2px solid currentColor;\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <h3>Pro</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">For professionals and small teams who ship every week.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div><span class=\"stat-value price\" data-monthly=\"$24\" data-annual=\"$19\">$24</span><span class=\"stat-label\"> / user / month</span></div>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" data-cycle-note=\"monthly\">Billed monthly. Min. 2 seats.</p>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" data-cycle-note=\"annual\" hidden>$228 / user / year — save $60 vs monthly.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-lg btn-block\">Start 14-day Pro trial</button>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Unlimited projects</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Up to 10 seats</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>50 GB file storage</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Email support (24h)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Custom dashboards</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>20+ integrations</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Advanced analytics &amp; exports</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm muted\"><span>—</span><span>Audit log &amp; SSO</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">All Free features included, plus version history for 90 days.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Team -->\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <h3>Team</h3>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">For scaling orgs</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Administration, security and collaboration for whole departments.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div><span class=\"stat-value price\" data-monthly=\"$48\" data-annual=\"$38\">$48</span><span class=\"stat-label\"> / user / month</span></div>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" data-cycle-note=\"monthly\">Billed monthly. Min. 5 seats.</p>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" data-cycle-note=\"annual\" hidden>$456 / user / year — save $120 vs monthly.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Talk to sales</button>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Everything in Pro</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Unlimited seats</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>1 TB file storage</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Priority support (4h)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Role-based permissions</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Unlimited integrations + API</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Audit log, SSO (SAML)</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span>✓</span><span>Dedicated success manager</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Custom contracts, invoicing and onboarding available.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <h3>Compare every feature</h3>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"badge\">Included</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Add-on</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>Feature</th><th class=\"num\">Free</th><th class=\"num\">Pro</th><th class=\"num\">Team</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Projects</td><td class=\"num\">3</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Seats</td><td class=\"num\">1</td><td class=\"num\">up to 10</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Storage</td><td class=\"num\">2 GB</td><td class=\"num\">50 GB</td><td class=\"num\">1 TB</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Version history</td><td class=\"num\">7 days</td><td class=\"num\">90 days</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Integrations</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">20+</td><td class=\"num\">Unlimited</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>API access</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num badge-outline\">Add-on</td><td class=\"num\">Included</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Advanced analytics</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">Included</td><td class=\"num\">Included</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>SSO / SAML</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">Included</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Audit log</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">—</td><td class=\"num\">Included</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Support SLA</td><td class=\"num\">Community</td><td class=\"num\">24h email</td><td class=\"num\">4h priority</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">Seats above plan limits can be added for $12 / user / month on Pro and $22 on Team.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <h3>How teams use each plan</h3>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Active workspaces by plan\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Free\",\"value\":8200},{\"label\":\"Pro\",\"value\":3400},{\"label\":\"Team\",\"value\":800}]}'>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Free accounts convert to paid at 34% within 90 days; Team accounts renew at 96%.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <h3>Switching between plans</h3>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Upgrade</span><span class=\"muted small\">Immediate, prorated to the day</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Downgrade</span><span class=\"muted small\">Takes effect at the end of the cycle</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Annual refund</span><span class=\"muted small\">Within 14 days, full refund</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"stat-label\">Nonprofit / student</span><span class=\"muted small\">50% off Pro and Team</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"alert\">\n        <strong>Need something custom?</strong>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Over 50 seats or on-prem? We offer volume pricing and a private cloud deployment.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Read the pricing FAQ</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Book a 20-min walkthrough</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-sm center\">\n    <h3>Ready to start?</h3>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">Join thousands of teams shipping faster with the right plan for their size.</p>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-lg\">Create free account</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-lg btn-secondary\">Start Pro trial</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-lg btn-ghost\">Contact sales</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var radios = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"cycle\"]');\n  radios.forEach(function (r) {\n    r.addEventListener('change', function () {\n      var mode = r.value;\n      document.querySelectorAll('.price').forEach(function (el) {\n        el.textContent = el.getAttribute('data-' + mode);\n      });\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-cycle-note]').forEach(function (el) {\n        el.hidden = el.getAttribute('data-cycle-note') !== mode;\n      });\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[864,"<div"],[882," class=\"stack"],[985," gap"],[995,"-lg\">\n "],[995," <div"],[1123," class=\"stack gap"],[1133,"-sm"],[1195," center\">\n   "],[1205," <"],[1205,"h1>Plans"],[1335," that grow with your"],[1406," team</h1"],[1416,">\n    <"],[1480,"p class=\""],[1486,"lead muted\">Start"],[1548," free"],[1610," forever. Upgrade when"],[1621," you"],[1738," need more projects,"],[1746," seats"],[1817," and automation. No"],[1830," credit card"],[1858," required for the Free"],[1869," plan.</p>"],[1943,"\n    <div"],[2025," class=\"row gap"],[2035,"-sm\">\n     "],[2035," <span"],[2193," class=\"badge\">"],[2300,"14-day refund"],[2323," window</span>"],[2333,"\n"],[2333,"      <span class"],[2415,"=\"badge b